Package: ai.operit
Name: Operit2 (device automation, rootless)
Version: 0.3.9
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Operit2 iOS device-automation substrate for rootless jailbreaks (Dopamine/ElleKit). SpringBoard control tweak (screenshot/launch/home/tap/swipe/longpress/type/front) + per-app injected dylib (type injection into focused field) + resident agent daemon (operit_agent_daemon) running as a LaunchDaemon. The daemon hosts the visual agent loop (screenshot -> autoglm-phone VLM -> normalized 0-999 coords -> device actions) and is driven over /var/jb/var/mobile/.operit/agent.sock. UI (Operit2 Flutter app) is packaged separately.
Maintainer: operit2-ios <local@example.com>
Author: operit2-ios
Section: Utilities
Depends: ellekit
Tag: cydia::compatible::ios15
